New: TriaAccessor::refinement_choice() returns the RefinementChoice with which
an object has been refined and CellAccessor::refinement_choice_set() returns
the RefinementChoice with which a cell is flagged to be refined. Cells can
now be flagged for refinement with CellAccessor::set_refine_flag(), which
takes a RefinementChoice. Triangulation now uses RefinementChoice internally.
<br>
